# This keeps your local cache and junk out of everyone else's clone.
# =======================================================
# Local app configs
# Named explicitly rather than as `.*` — that pattern matched `.gitignore`
# itself and `.github/`, so neither could ever be committed.
.claude/
.obsidian/
.remember/
# =======================================================
# Local cache
tools/gtidocs-mirror/.cache/
/docs/Resources/tools/gtidocs-mirror/.cache/
/graphify-out
# =======================================================
# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# =======================================================
